# LoopOps Avatar App

Web app for **Actinver** talking-head avatar. Not the LoopOps web app or marketing website.

## Stack

- Vite, React 19, TypeScript
- TanStack Router (code-based tree in `apps/web/src/router.tsx`)
- Tailwind CSS v4 (`apps/web/src/styles/tokens.css` + `global.css`)
- HeyGen **LiveAvatar** Web SDK, FULL mode ([docs.liveavatar.com](https://docs.liveavatar.com/))
- Backend: Python or TypeScript, LangChain / LangGraph, **Gemini** LLM
- Investment tools: portfolio lookup, news scraping, risk-tier product search, guided transaction flows

## Interaction modes

1. **Chat mode** — typed messages, text replies, avatar lip-sync
2. **Voice mode** — speech in/out via avatar session, hands-free conversation

Both modes share the same agent backend and session context.

## Structure

```
apps/web/src/
├── config/          # avatar + env config
├── styles/          # tokens.css (primitives) + global.css (Tailwind wiring)
├── services/        # API client + backend calls
├── features/
│   └── avatar/      # demo: components/, hooks/, types/
├── router.tsx       # route tree, lazy routes from features
└── main.tsx
```

## Commands

- `npm run dev` — dev server (port 8080, `/liveavatar-api` proxy)
- `npm run build` — typecheck + build
- `npm run check` / `npm run lint` / `npm test`
